  "description": "Watch now | The market is showing signs of life...",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Friday! Yesterday’s rally brought about some much needed excitement. We have yet to confirm a break out though…so remain cautious, as we do not know if it was a dead cat bounce, or the market is truly turning around to <em><strong>trend</strong></em> higher. As always, I will keep you updated. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Above I talk about Gold and Silver. This was a pretty quiet week, as we do not throw money in the market, when the market is not working. That does not mean run away… it is always quiet before the big moves. We are simply waiting on breakouts right now.</p><p>The only major update this week was the <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-etf-20?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF 2.0</a>;</strong> the original is tripling the performance of the S&amp;P 500, and is designed for year+ investors who do not want to stare at charts and want to ignore the news. </p><p>Have a nice weekend. Step away from the charts. Its good to refresh your mind so you come in sharp the next week. As always, if you have questions, feel free to stop by the main chat during market hours with any questions, or if you just want to say hi! </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "Happy Friday! Yesterday’s rally brought about some much needed excitement. We have yet to confirm a break out though…so remain cautious, as we do not know if it was a dead cat bounce, or the market is truly turning around to trend higher. As always, I will keep you updated.",
